    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T16:23:02Z",
    "body": "It's not clear what the spec bug is here. There are many attributes on the platform that are order-sensitive in what effect they have due to interdependencies between them. `<input>` elements have a lot of interdependent attributes in the same element, but for example so do `<audio>` and `<video>`. Your two pieces of code do different things, and should indeed behave differently per spec.",
