    "body": "I think what @wycats didn't highlight is that you get different results through the HTML parser which sets these all at once. I think that is illustrative of needing the hook browsers have to set multiple attributes at once, which I thought we all agreed was a bug and something we did not want to expose to custom elements (and hope to remove any dependencies of if we found them).",
