    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T16:32:46Z",
    "body": "I see. Brainstorming a solution: we add some kind of dirty value flag for input type=range (or reuse the one that's already present for all inputs?), and if that's not set, then suffering from underflow/overflow/step mismatch tries to set to the default value (or some version of the default value which also respects step=\"\").",
