    "created_at": "2017-03-10T09:13:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-10T09:13:27Z",
    "body": "In some places (at least `img`, `video`) we have deliberately tried to make attribute order not matter. I think that is generally a good thing, `input` specifically seems like it should follow that principle.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
