    "updated_at": "2017-08-03T20:20:54Z",
    "body": "I'm unassigning myself as I haven't been able to find a good model here and don't believe I'll have time to work one out. I'd welcome community help (or Safari engineer help) in determining what model Safari uses and whether it suits our purposes of avoiding order-dependent attribute setting. If we can find that model I can re-commit to taking time to spec it.\r\n\r\nOne way of starting this is to propose a reasonable model that matches Safari's results for all of the tests in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/range.html . #2661 is not such a model, as discussed above.",
